/Original result folders

# Result folders moved aside before a dataset re-sync, kept only so the
# previous runs stay recoverable. Large and machine-local, like the results
# directory itself above.
/archived-results

# One-off `--out` targets for re-running a single dataset while chasing a fix,
# kept out of the results directory so they never reach its batch metrics.
# Same machine-local run output as the two above.
/verify-*
/dataset-out
/ai-gen-dataset-out
